      "name": "Auspex — 1 Basic — Heightened Senses",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>You may double the range of your sight and hearing and sharpen your other senses to remarkable acuity, perceiving things ordinary folk cannot. A sudden sensory assault, such as a loud noise or strong odor, numbs the affected sense for the rest of the scene and stuns you for a turn unless you spend a Willpower Trait. You may also receive uncontrollable visions of past or future events.</p>",
